<title>USA: HA-LO, PACE form strategic alliance.</title>
<headline>HA-LO, PACE form strategic alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc, a distributor of specialty and premium advertising products, said on Tuesday it signed a three-year alliance with PACE Entertainment Corp of Houston.</p>
<p>PACE produces live entertainment in the United States.</p>
<p>The companies intend to create proprietary merchandise and specialty and premium products to be used by PACE in promotional activities and for sale to others.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
